WEBVTT

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.620
If you're sure I'm
the one you want--

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.910
May I take
that as a "yes"?

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.020
Yes.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:57.420
Thank you. I've waited
so long for your answer.

00:01:57.530 --> 00:01:59.120
I was almost
afraid to hear it.

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:03.130
I'm sorry I took
so long to decide.

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:04.860
No!

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:06.560
You mean
they're already--

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.460
You never know, huh?

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:10.560
I'll confirm the party
and call you.

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:12.310
Please do!
I'll be waiting.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:24.100
I had no idea of the events
taking place.

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:38.630
40,OOO, and it comes
with a bath. Not bad.

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:40.630
Godai!

00:02:41.030 --> 00:02:42.330
Manager!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.370
What are you
looking at?

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:46.780
Apartments that
come with a bath.

00:02:47.410 --> 00:02:50.400
Going to the public baths
must be so inconvenient.

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:51.440
Sure is.

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:56.370
Moving away?

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.120
Yeah--

00:02:58.950 --> 00:02:59.930
Y'mean me?

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:03.710
Oh, no! Why would I move?

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:05.890
I'm looking
for a friend.

00:03:06.230 --> 00:03:09.330
Oh. Don't scare
me like that.

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:18.770
I sometimes
wonder about it...

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:22.100
But the tenants of Maison
Ikkoku never move away, right?

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:23.890
That's right.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.700
I know that someday we'll
go our separate ways.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:32.030
But right now, I can't
believe that day will come.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:36.250
That's why you
surprised me back there.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.210
Back when I was a ronin
I always thought about leaving,

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:42.920
but now, it doesn't
even enter my mind.

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.650
I'm glad to hear it.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:55.440
Let me carry that.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.280
So what was
the big event?

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:11.180
Your creepy grin is
makin' me sick.

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:14.410
Then don't look. You can't
spoil my good mood tonight.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:18.420
Unusual for Godai
to be in such a mood.

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:21.950
It's gotta be somethin'
stupid 'bout the manager.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:26.340
Speaking of the manager, did
you hear from Mrs. Ichinose?

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:28.730
Sure did!
Quite a story!

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:31.240
W-What story?

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:35.320
D-Does it have to
do with the manager?

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:38.710
And we promised not
to let Godai know!

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.780
It will just depress
your good mood.

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:43.390
Don't ask.

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.440
I-I'm asking!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.350
Coach Mitaka...

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:49.270
...finally popped--

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:50.600
Wait a sec!

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.600
You know that you got
the story wrong somewhere.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:54.960
Probably.

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:57.290
If only it were so.

00:04:57.440 --> 00:05:00.200
Aha! So you
are pulling my leg!

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.230
No, we have simply
yet to confirm it.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:05.970
But, if you
asked the manager--

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:09.170
"I hear you and Coach Stud
are gonna get hitched!"

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:12.110
"Oh dear, doesn't
good news travel fast!"

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:14.850
Got any
reply for that?

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:17.590
Of course not.
Not you especially.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.390
No way! You guys
just got mixed up!

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.130
Oh! Mrs. Ichinose...

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.840
Is something wrong?
Come in.

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.170
--Tell me.
--Yes?

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:38.240
You got anything
to say to me?

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:40.410
I mean, about...

00:05:42.630 --> 00:05:44.110
Please, come in.

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:46.530
Otonashi here.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:48.340
Coach Mitaka!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:50.710
Did you find a
nice wedding chapel?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:52.380
Yes.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.220
--Yes, I know.
-- 'Scuse me.

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:56.850
Just a minute!

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:25.710
So much for
bein' friends.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:57.520
How ya doin'?
Aren't you cold?

00:07:01.460 --> 00:07:03.890
I'm celebratin'.
Have one on me.

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:09.100
Finally opened
a bottle of my best.

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:14.810
Did something
good happen?

00:07:16.820 --> 00:07:19.500
The manager's married life
starts here.

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:29.680
Did you hear
it from her directly?

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.180
'Course not.

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:32.480
Then maybe--

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:38.420
Godai, I like you too
much to lie about this.

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:41.730
Down it.

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.910
I'm happy to have you
by my side in this.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:08.250
Yes...

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:11.360
But are you sure
it's me that you want?

00:08:11.570 --> 00:08:14.630
If I said that you were
the only one I considered...

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.000
...would that
calm your fears?

00:08:28.780 --> 00:08:29.440
You're kidding!

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:30.910
No really! I swear!

00:08:34.520 --> 00:08:36.110
So then what?

00:08:47.940 --> 00:08:49.020
Godai!

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:52.130
R-Running errands?

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.470
I had to meet
Coach Mitaka.

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.810
About the marriage?

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:06.170
Then you've heard!

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:23.280
Goodbye.

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:34.370
Godai--

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:09.540
Get set!

00:10:11.150 --> 00:10:11.810
Go!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.890
Somewhere, I smelled
something sweet.

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:34.220
You're not serious?

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.260
Godai?

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:40.310
There!
Ready to go!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.930
Yields easily, doesn't he?

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:44.480
He's so stupid.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:46.770
The game's not over
'til the final gun.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:49.010
He's only got
two strikes on him.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:52.380
I didn't know baseball
was a timed sport.

00:10:53.030 --> 00:10:54.520
Have you a
new address?

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:57.210
I'll find someplace.
I'm still young.

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.830
What'll we
tell the manager!?

00:11:03.500 --> 00:11:08.130
Tell her "thanks." And
to watch for the movers.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:09.860
I'm home.

00:11:19.520 --> 00:11:20.580
Going out?

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:22.850
Out for the count.

00:11:22.920 --> 00:11:27.550
Catch one parting glimpse;
Of one catching wanderlust;
Soon to catch a cold.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.720
Forgive me, the proper
poetry escapes me.

00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.250
Manager--

00:11:35.870 --> 00:11:36.600
Yes?

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:53.740
What's up?
Whatcha all doin'?

00:11:53.960 --> 00:11:55.440
I'm not sure.

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:56.850
Manager--

00:11:56.920 --> 00:11:57.880
Yes?

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:00.330
I...   I...

00:12:01.730 --> 00:12:03.060
I don't know
how to say--

00:12:04.130 --> 00:12:05.890
Or even
what to say...

00:12:06.600 --> 00:12:08.030
...but, Manager,
I wanted--

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.160
But, Kyoko,
I wanted to say...

00:12:14.850 --> 00:12:16.030
...thank you.

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.500
Thank you for what?

00:12:27.420 --> 00:12:29.250
Wait! Godai!

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.600
What? Me?
Married to Mitaka!?

00:12:58.250 --> 00:13:00.740
His SISTER is
getting married!

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:03.580
I'm just helping with
the reception plans.

00:13:04.390 --> 00:13:06.150
Where did this rumor come from!?

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:09.060
Now's not the
time for blame!

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:13.060
Godai really left for good!
What'll we do?

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:14.750
Nothing we can do.

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:17.730
He'll return when
he grows hungry.

00:13:19.770 --> 00:13:21.320
Ma, I'm starvin'!

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:25.000
The vey next day,
I found my new place.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:32.010
C'mon in! No better place than
Grand Universe Pinball Parlor!

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:35.180
Relieve your stress!
Win great prizes!

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:47.730
It's open.

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:57.000
Can I help you?

00:13:57.110 --> 00:13:59.010
S-Sorry!
W-Wrong apartment!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:09.340
Grand Universe Pinball Parlor
second floor, number one.

00:14:12.060 --> 00:14:12.680
Yes?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:13.820
'Scuse me.

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:16.280
You again?

00:14:16.630 --> 00:14:19.650
I was supposed to move
into this apartment.

00:14:20.030 --> 00:14:23.960
Oh, so they found one!
Then come on in!

00:14:24.270 --> 00:14:25.430
What's going on?

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:35.310
Find Godai?

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.380
Did Godai phone you
or anything?

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.560
I haven't heard anything.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:43.180
Worried?

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:44.910
Not really.

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:48.020
I just don't want him to leave
with the wrong impression.

00:14:48.890 --> 00:14:51.750
I'd never leave Maison
Ikkoku unattended.

00:14:52.260 --> 00:14:54.930
Maison Ikkoku isn't
what he's upset about.

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:16.680
Hey, you--

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:17.880
Y-Yeah?

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:22.490
Put the table away, Hon.
I'll make the bed.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:23.750
O-Okay!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:29.490
I don't get this!

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:35.330
Get some sleep, Hon.
It's been a long day.

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:38.830
Whatsa matter?

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.610
L-Long day.
Sure been long.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:52.880
I'm home, Babe!

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.090
Delivery!

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:01.200
Thank you!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:05.660
It's for Godai.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:09.810
He moved and never
told his parents!

00:16:10.210 --> 00:16:12.000
A parcel?

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:13.840
Why ever do you hide it?

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:15.910
I'm not hiding it--

00:16:16.080 --> 00:16:21.100
It is for Godai!
Shall I take responsibility?

00:16:21.320 --> 00:16:22.610
You shall not!

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.930
I was not intending
to steal the contents.

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:28.180
I wasn't saying you were--

00:16:28.430 --> 00:16:29.390
You two--

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:31.350
Tell me what I'm missin'.

00:16:31.430 --> 00:16:35.620
The manager is hoarding
Godai's care package.

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:36.660
Yotsuya!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:40.400
For Godai?
Whatcha gonna do?

00:16:40.640 --> 00:16:42.830
I'm NOT hoarding it!

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:46.040
Everybody knows that.

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:52.140
I'd forward it, but there's
no forwarding address.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:56.200
I wonder if he
really wants to move.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:59.040
All his things
are still in Room 5.

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:02.950
Think he crawled
away to die?

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:05.620
Stop that!
He showed no warning signs--

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:06.520
Then again--

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:09.950
It is the 10th day.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.310
TEN days!

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:17.330
Did you hear me?
It's been ten days!

00:17:17.710 --> 00:17:21.040
When are you going
to move out!?

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.470
Quit screamin'!
Can't move with no money!

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:28.620
That's not what you said!
"Two, three days tops," you said!

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:33.560
Shut it! Yer sleepin'
on my futon, ain't ya?

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:38.260
Speaking of which, my things
will arrive this afternoon.

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:39.760
What!?

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:41.830
But it's so crowded--

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:46.230
Deal with it! I feel like
a boarder in my own place.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:50.430
That's funny, I was
thinking the same thing!

00:18:06.100 --> 00:18:08.520
I ought to return
it to his parents.

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:12.480
But his furniture
is still here--

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.930
No! Down!
I ain't got food!

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:17.260
Excuse me!

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:20.600
Coming!

00:18:23.850 --> 00:18:26.460
We're from the Moving Center.
Where's Room 5?

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:49.490
That about does it.

00:18:57.810 --> 00:19:00.040
Guess he meant it, after all.

00:19:04.820 --> 00:19:06.480
Wait a minute, please!

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:07.540
What is it?

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.480
I'm sorry!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:10.470
Take this--

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:13.850
I mean, could you give
me the new address?

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:16.210
Something happened,
and I never got it.

00:19:16.460 --> 00:19:18.050
Sure. No problem.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.760
"Clock Hill West"?

00:19:27.740 --> 00:19:29.700
That's just the next train stop.

00:20:41.980 --> 00:20:43.680
Okay, back to work.

00:21:07.270 --> 00:21:08.730
Is something funny?

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:14.210
You coulda mailed it
but you gotta hand-deliver it.

00:21:14.680 --> 00:21:16.470
No! I just--

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:20.350
I know. I know. You wanna
clear up the misunderstanding.

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:22.890
Godai'll be thrilled.

00:21:39.180 --> 00:21:40.390
Just my luck.

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:50.980
Care for some tea?
Your treat, of course.

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:55.540
Clock Hill West!
Clock Hill West!

00:22:01.230 --> 00:22:03.930
The doors are closing.
Please be careful.

00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:10.960
Umm--

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:15.460
Has the date been set
for the ceremony?

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:16.990
Come again?

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:18.950
The wedding--

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:22.800
And why must
I get married?

00:22:23.550 --> 00:22:25.740
Nobody's talking
about YOU!!

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:27.680
The marriage between
the manager and--

00:22:28.720 --> 00:22:32.010
T-The marriage between
the manager and Mitaka.

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:35.050
Oh that!
Then be at ease.

00:22:35.140 --> 00:22:36.390
Just a misunderstanding.

00:22:38.030 --> 00:22:39.750
Misunder--

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:08.740
Yeah?

00:23:10.590 --> 00:23:11.520
Who's there?

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:14.200
Isn't this Godai's room?

00:23:14.680 --> 00:23:15.890
Sure is.

00:23:16.030 --> 00:23:18.820
Excuse me, but
who are you?

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:22.160
We're living together.

00:23:22.510 --> 00:23:23.470
l...

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:30.600
...See.

00:23:50.380 --> 00:23:53.460
Room 5 has been rented!

00:23:53.770 --> 00:23:55.320
Rooms 2 and 3 as well!

00:23:55.440 --> 00:23:58.070
There's no room for
Godai at Maison Ikkoku!

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:01.970
Next: "Scandal at Ikkoku!
Godai's Shacking Up!?"

00:24:02.550 --> 00:24:05.820
You left Maison Ikkoku
not me.
